{"id":"64ced038ad7f8f73","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-local-homeomorphism.md","title":"Local Homeomorphism","display":"df-local-homeomorphism — Local Homeomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-local-homeomorphism","aliases":["58-df-local-homeomorphism","Local Homeomorphism"],"display":"df-local-homeomorphism — Local Homeomorphism","depends_on":["[[58-df-homeomorphism]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-local-homeomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-local-homeomorphism</span><span>Local Homeomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-homeomorphism — Local Homeomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"58-df-homeomorphism\">58-df-homeomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\)</span> (topological spaces)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span> (map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in X\">\\(x \\in X\\)</span> (point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocalHomeo}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{LocalHomeo}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (local-homeomorphism predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\)</span> (homeomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"58-df-homeomorphism\">58-df-homeomorphism</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{LocalHomeo}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_Y\\;\\left(x\\in U\\land f[U]=V\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f\\upharpoonright U,U,\\{O\\cap U:O\\in\\tau_X\\},V,\\{O\\cap V:O\\in\\tau_Y\\})\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{LocalHomeo}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_Y\\;\\left(x\\in U\\land f[U]=V\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f\\upharpoonright U,U,\\{O\\cap U:O\\in\\tau_X\\},V,\\{O\\cap V:O\\in\\tau_Y\\})\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Local homeomorphism: locally invertible; open mapping with local inverses</li>\n<li>Sheaf: local homeomorphisms characterize étale spaces of sheaves</li>\n<li>Covering map: local homeo with discrete fibers; path lifting</li>\n<li>Branched cover: local homeo except at branch points; critical values</li>\n<li>Lifting and universal-cover consequences are downstream atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-homeomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homeomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homeomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homeo}_S$ (homeomorphism predicate, see [[58-df-homeomorphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"x \\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocalHomeo}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{LocalHomeo}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_Y\\;\\left(x\\in U\\land f[U]=V\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f\\upharpoonright U,U,\\{O\\cap U:O\\in\\tau_X\\},V,\\{O\\cap V:O\\in\\tau_Y\\})\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1574,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93778b32bbd2327","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-793","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-local-homeomorphism.md|58-df-local-homeomorphism]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["c4b4a825f2ea608d","815e63e5071e7b58","36d7463d215be751"]}